{"title":"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the degree measures of the angles of a triangle are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853214fcfe9d43f5a49fc9a74b78c3ada74a41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:3:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, what is the degree measure of the largest angle of the triangle?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd00e7776af5c893976a049c2d3409ca5c6cb2e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }18\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }36\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }60\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }72\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the ratios is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  Since the sum of the angles of a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, the ratio can be scaled up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfa07fe49750b5b03f5f806582c0f60e7700de75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54:54:72$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a696f4ee7d0b89887a286ca0b8cb3f3751635210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3\\cdot 18:3\\cdot 18:4\\cdot 18).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" />  The numbers in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfa07fe49750b5b03f5f806582c0f60e7700de75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54:54:72$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" /> represent the angles of the triangle.  The question asks for the largest, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c58317b7e69602ad581efa935aea6d95a193efa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can denote the angles of the triangle as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. Due to the sum of the angles in a triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/1528bd83e08d3321ec94dcacbd9c257f91ea8ca7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+3x+4x=180^{\\circ}\\implies x=18^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"274\" height=\"16\" />. The greatest angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> and after substitution we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c58317b7e69602ad581efa935aea6d95a193efa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2CmjcUwuYoE\">https://youtu.be/2CmjcUwuYoE</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=635\">https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=635</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ykR1ApGP0Qg\">https://youtu.be/ykR1ApGP0Qg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8\" title=\"2017 AMC 8\">2017 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\